 "url": "https://forum.netmarble.com/futurefight_en/view/2213/1634073",
 "html": "<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><img alt=\"\" id=\"1596010706784\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/fb5a9d45e9ec434e8ffed62f9f77f026_1596010706784_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Greetings, Agents!</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">This is CM Fragment of MARVEL Future Fight.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Two Heroes have appeared with fun, new looks to join our Agents this summer!<br>\nWe will introduce Cable &amp; Enchantress who will make your days feel like summer any time of year!</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Cable’s Summer Days uniform can be purchased with Crystals.<br>\nEnchantress’s Summer Days uniform can be obtained with Magic Tokens.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Enjoy a nice, cool summer alongside these two Heroes with their new costumes in MARVEL Future Fight!</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">[7/30 3:16 a.m. (UTC+0) / 7/29 8:16 p.m. (PDT) Added]</span></span></strong></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">The patch has been completed. Please reconnect to the game and download the patch file.</span></span></strong></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\"><strong>■ 7/30 Patch</strong></span></span></span><br>\n&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><strong>&nbsp;Patch Schedule: </strong>7/30 2:00 a.m. (UTC+0) / 7/29 7:00 p.m. (PDT)<br>\n<span style=\"color:#c0392b;\">* The patch will be applied in waves, so the patch application time may vary.<br>\n* The game can be played during the patch,&nbsp;<br>\nbut we recommend our Agents reconnect to the game to apply the patch once it is available.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">▣ &lt;Summer Days&gt; Uniforms</span></span></strong></span>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" id=\"1596010844811\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/588098b3b56a4d05bd4ec2456954f20f_1596010844811_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" id=\"1596010844797\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/a5b80643b6d442b68380f87a4d40b0e7_1596010844797_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#e74c3c;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">* New Character Skills are based on Level 6 stats.<br>\n* The 2 new uniforms will be available for purchase during the event.<br>\nEnchantress &lt;Summer Days&gt;: After the 7/30 Patch - 8/13 2:59 p.m. (UTC+0) / After the 7/30 Patch - 8/13 7:59 a.m. (PDT)<br>\nCable &lt;Summer Days&gt;: After the 7/30 Patch - Until the next Update<br>\n* Once the Event finishes, the &lt;Summer Days&gt; uniforms may return in the future through similar events, packages, etc.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><strong>▣ Enchantress’s Potential Awakened</strong></span></span></span>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" id=\"1596010906602\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/679da970ba4b4160b0f093c4a0515096_1596010906602_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Events have also been prepared for Cable &amp; Enchantress!<br>\nCheck out the Event notices and complete missions!</span></span></p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Thank you.</span></span>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"169\" id=\"1596010926780\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/b7664572b0a54d0797cb120429246b64_1596010926780_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" width=\"732\"></p>\n"
